sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Người dùng
    participant BG as batch_graph 🔲M4
    participant EG as enrichment_graph ✅
    participant DB as Postgres (app)
    participant AG as approval_graph 🔲M5
    actor ACC as Kế toán

    U->>BG: upload N hóa đơn
    BG->>BG: ingest + cost_gate 🔲M4
    BG->>EG: Send × N (max_concurrency=4–6)
    loop mỗi hóa đơn
        EG->>EG: route → parse/vision → validate ✅
        EG->>EG: classify → audit → signals 🔲M4
        EG->>DB: llm_calls (ngay lúc đốt token) ✅
    end
    EG-->>BG: JOIN ngầm — mọi Send xong
    BG->>DB: reconcile_budget SERIAL 🔲M4
    BG->>BG: route_outcomes 🔲M4

    alt sạch (~26/30)
        BG->>DB: auto_post → journal_entries 🔲M5
    else có cờ (~4/30)
        BG->>DB: INSERT approvals (decision NULL) 🔲M5
        BG->>AG: ainvoke(thread=appr:{id})
        AG-->>BG: __interrupt__ ⏸
        Note over BG: batch KẾT THÚC ở đây<br/>KHÔNG chờ người duyệt
    end

    Note over ACC: … vài giờ / sang hôm sau …
    ACC->>AG: Command(resume={decision, reason})
    AG->>DB: đọc lại approvals — guard 🔲M5.3
    AG->>DB: journal_entries / record_rejection 🔲M5
    AG->>DB: learn → episodic + vendors 🔲M5.4
